== Bundled fonts

The fonts are the files Asciidoctor PDF 2.3.27 and prawn-icon 3.0.0 ship,
unmodified (stored zlib-compressed and ASCII85-encoded in the data_*.mbt
files by scripts/pdf_bundle_fonts.mbtx of the asciidoctor.mbt repository).
A PDF made with them embeds subsets of them; the font licenses do not apply
to such documents.

